1
00:00:01,139 --> 00:00:02,648
[Boyd] <i>Previously, on</i>
<font color="#ffff00">"From"...</font>

2
00:00:02,733 --> 00:00:04,986
Is Daddy coming home?

3
00:00:05,071 --> 00:00:06,272
Any second now.

4
00:00:06,357 --> 00:00:07,637
You go start saying
your prayers.

5
00:00:07,754 --> 00:00:09,208
I'll be there
in a minute.

6
00:00:09,293 --> 00:00:12,906
- Meagan, what are you doing?
- Maybe I can come in.

7
00:00:13,236 --> 00:00:16,406
- Meagan, no!
- [Screams]

8
00:00:19,809 --> 00:00:21,246
[Boyd] You want a drink, huh?

9
00:00:21,377 --> 00:00:23,252
- Get the...
- No.

10
00:00:23,337 --> 00:00:25,079
A man protects
his family, Frank.

11
00:00:25,164 --> 00:00:26,420
Open your eyes
and look!

12
00:00:26,513 --> 00:00:28,311
Look at what you did.
Look at them.

13
00:00:28,396 --> 00:00:29,571
No!

14
00:00:29,663 --> 00:00:32,753
Tell my parents I said goodbye.

15
00:00:32,877 --> 00:00:34,994
Mom, Julie killed Norman.

16
00:00:35,079 --> 00:00:37,970
- What happened to Norman?
- The monsters killed them.

17
00:00:38,055 --> 00:00:40,011
There's no such thing
as monsters, honey.

18
00:00:40,096 --> 00:00:41,924
Why is there a tree
in the middle of the road?

19
00:00:42,009 --> 00:00:44,096
Must've gotten knocked down
in a storm or something.

20
00:00:44,181 --> 00:00:46,400
Oh, this can't be
the same place.

21
00:00:46,824 --> 00:00:48,625
Excuse me?

22
00:00:48,908 --> 00:00:51,998
We're trying to get back onto
the highway. Could you...

23
00:00:52,083 --> 00:00:54,943
- We're on the same fucking road.
- [Tires squeal]

24
00:01:03,458 --> 00:01:05,181
[Moans]

25
00:01:05,281 --> 00:01:07,740
Dad, I think he's bleeding.
There's something in his leg.

26
00:01:07,825 --> 00:01:08,828
Are you a doctor?

27
00:01:08,913 --> 00:01:10,734
I was a third-year
medical student.

28
00:01:10,819 --> 00:01:14,627
Please stop.
It hurts. Ow!

29
00:01:14,712 --> 00:01:16,932
- [Tires blow]
- We can make it to Colony House.

30
00:01:17,017 --> 00:01:18,625
Run as fast as you can,
no matter what you see.

31
00:01:18,709 --> 00:01:20,879
No matter what you hear,
you do not stop.

32
00:01:20,964 --> 00:01:24,401
- Hey, I need help here!
- [Shouting]

33
00:01:24,535 --> 00:01:26,387
[Ellis]
Hey. Hey! Donna, let us in!

34
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,286
[Gunshot]

35
00:01:27,371 --> 00:01:28,960
[Victor] You're from one
of those two cars?

36
00:01:29,032 --> 00:01:31,583
That hasn't happened
in a long, long time.

37
00:01:31,668 --> 00:01:33,297
What do you think it means?

38
00:01:33,428 --> 00:01:36,400
There are things you need to
know about where you are.

39
00:01:36,501 --> 00:01:39,611
This, unfortunately, is gonna be
the worst conversation

40
00:01:39,696 --> 00:01:40,500
of your life.

41
00:01:40,585 --> 00:01:42,021
Do you believe
in monsters?

42
00:01:42,112 --> 00:01:43,376
[Julie]
Why did you bring me here?

43
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:46,101
'Cause I wanted you
to see that if you climb

44
00:01:46,186 --> 00:01:49,420
high enough, even a nightmare
can look like a dream.

45
00:01:49,505 --> 00:01:52,212
- This isn't your fault.
- What do you mean?

46
00:01:52,297 --> 00:01:53,900
I hear their voices.

47
00:01:53,985 --> 00:01:56,101
They said it was
the only way to go home.

48
00:01:56,186 --> 00:01:58,200
Sara, just tell me
what you did.

49
00:01:58,285 --> 00:01:59,796
I left the door open.

50
00:01:59,881 --> 00:02:03,166
- [Glass shatters]
- Those things. They walk.

51
00:02:03,251 --> 00:02:04,379
They never run.

52
00:02:04,464 --> 00:02:07,337
They know there's only
so many places we can go.

53
00:02:07,422 --> 00:02:09,598
I feel like I'm hanging on
by a thread here.

54
00:02:09,683 --> 00:02:12,857
I can't find any more bodies.

55
00:02:12,941 --> 00:02:13,971
[Sobs]

56
00:02:14,056 --> 00:02:16,902
- What are you looking at?
- Nothing.

57
00:02:25,025 --> 00:02:26,809
[Lighter clicks]

58
00:02:34,164 --> 00:02:36,036
[moaning]

59
00:02:46,918 --> 00:02:50,095
- Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
- Come on! Come on!

60
00:02:50,441 --> 00:02:52,008
Open the damn door!

61
00:02:53,749 --> 00:02:55,490
- [Gunshot]
- [Gasps]

62
00:02:59,581 --> 00:03:02,410
[Breathes heavily]

63
00:03:04,064 --> 00:03:05,718
You have a bad dream?

64
00:03:05,848 --> 00:03:07,415
Yeah.

65
00:03:09,069 --> 00:03:11,074
Yeah. Yeah.

66
00:03:15,703 --> 00:03:17,733
[Jade]
Tobey!

67
00:03:18,149 --> 00:03:20,553
Somebody get me out of
this fucking thing. Hey!

68
00:03:20,767 --> 00:03:22,999
- Tobey, where are you?
- [Woman] What's going on?

69
00:03:23,083 --> 00:03:24,595
Anybody fucking... Hey.

70
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,579
Shut the fuck up.
People are trying to sleep.

71
00:03:26,664 --> 00:03:29,089
- Who the fuck are you?
- Sorry.

72
00:03:29,219 --> 00:03:31,004
I'm usually more cordial
when I do this.

73
00:03:31,134 --> 00:03:33,180
[Exhales sharply]

74
00:03:33,311 --> 00:03:35,965
You picked one hell of a time
to finally wake up.

75
00:03:36,111 --> 00:03:37,311
Listen. I don't know
what's going on here,

76
00:03:37,395 --> 00:03:39,588
alright, but you get me outta
these fucking straps

77
00:03:39,673 --> 00:03:41,624
right fucking now,
or I swear to God I'm...

78
00:03:41,709 --> 00:03:43,321
What?

79
00:03:45,192 --> 00:03:46,541
Do you have any idea
who I am?

80
00:03:46,672 --> 00:03:48,108
Oh, shit.
You're one of those.

81
00:03:48,551 --> 00:03:49,805
One of what?

82
00:03:50,269 --> 00:03:51,313
Okay.

83
00:03:52,982 --> 00:03:54,636
Let's start
at the beginning.

84
00:04:08,757 --> 00:04:10,062
[Groans]

85
00:04:31,281 --> 00:04:32,848
[Exhales]

86
00:04:38,027 --> 00:04:40,465
[Blinds rattle]

87
00:04:52,797 --> 00:04:57,367
<i>"Que Sera, Sera
Whatever Will Be, will Be" plays...</i>

88
00:04:58,411 --> 00:04:59,921
<font color=#FF00FF>*FROM*</font>
<font color=#00FF00>Season 01  Episode 03</font>

89
