Episode Title: <font color=#FFc30f>"Choosing Day"</font>
Aired on: <font color="#00ffff">March 06, 2022.</font>

90
00:05:02,374 --> 00:05:07,179
<i>♪ When I was
just a little boy ♪</i>

91
00:05:07,333 --> 00:05:09,814
<i>♪ I asked
my father ♪</i>

92
00:05:09,899 --> 00:05:13,250
<i>♪ "What will
I be?" ♪</i>

93
00:05:13,579 --> 00:05:15,898
<i>♪ "Will I
be handsome?" ♪</i>

94
00:05:15,977 --> 00:05:18,284
<i>♪ "Will I
be rich?" ♪</i>

95
00:05:18,415 --> 00:05:22,201
<i>♪ Here's what
he said to me ♪</i>

96
