00:46:17,350 --> 00:46:20,397
[Door creaks]

777
00:46:30,755 --> 00:46:33,279
You get
these people home, Sheriff.

778
00:46:33,410 --> 00:46:35,542
I'll do everything I can.

779
00:46:35,673 --> 00:46:38,197
Promise me?

780
00:46:38,328 --> 00:46:40,156
Yeah, Frank.

781
00:46:40,286 --> 00:46:41,592
I promise.

782
00:46:57,825 --> 00:46:59,392
I'm ready.

783
00:47:07,574 --> 00:47:11,752
[Door closes, rattles]

784
00:47:11,883 --> 00:47:14,407
[Clears throat]

785
00:47:14,538 --> 00:47:16,061
[Lock clanks]

786
00:47:19,847 --> 00:47:21,240
Okay.

787
00:47:28,682 --> 00:47:30,423
[Onlookers murmuring]

788
00:48:07,895 --> 00:48:11,682
<i>"If It Be Your Will" plays...</i>

789
00:48:11,812 --> 00:48:15,468
<i>♪ If it be your will ♪</i>

790
00:48:17,601 --> 00:48:20,343
<i>♪ That I speak no more ♪</i>

791
00:48:23,225 --> 00:48:26,141
<i>♪ And my voice be still... ♪</i>

792
00:48:26,573 --> 00:48:27,705
Careful. In you go.

793
00:48:28,003 --> 00:48:32,703
<i>♪ As it was before... ♪</i>

794
00:48:32,833 --> 00:48:34,760
There's one outside.

795
00:48:35,020 --> 00:48:38,502
<i>♪ I will speak no more ♪</i>

796
00:48:39,014 --> 00:48:42,017
<i>- ♪ I shall abide until... ♪</i>
- Let's get you settled in.

797
00:48:46,978 --> 00:48:49,720
<i>♪ I am spoken for... ♪</i>

798
00:48:51,243 --> 00:48:53,680
<i>- ♪ If it be your will ♪</i>
- [Sighs]

799
00:48:58,511 --> 00:49:01,166
<i>♪ If it be your will ♪</i>

800
00:49:04,387 --> 00:49:06,519
<i>♪ That a voice be true ♪</i>

801
00:49:09,914 --> 00:49:12,612
<i>♪ From this broken hill ♪</i>

802
00:49:14,875 --> 00:49:18,314
<i>♪ I will sing to you ♪</i>

803
00:49:21,534 --> 00:49:25,060
<i>♪ From this broken hill ♪</i>

804
00:49:25,190 --> 00:49:29,673
<i>♪ All your praises
They shall ring... ♪</i>

805
00:49:32,023 --> 00:49:33,198
<i>Speaks Cantonese...</i>

806
00:49:33,329 --> 00:49:35,635
<i>♪ If it be your will ♪</i>

807
00:49:35,766 --> 00:49:37,463
<i>♪ To let me sing... ♪</i>

808
00:49:37,602 --> 00:49:41,388
This is, uh...
this is Jade.

809
00:49:50,369 --> 00:49:51,718
Uh, let's get you set up.

810
00:49:51,803 --> 00:49:53,587
<i>♪ If there is a choice... ♪</i>

811
00:49:54,001 --> 00:49:56,395
[Cries]

812
00:49:56,526 --> 00:49:59,746
♪ Let the rivers fill ♪

813
00:50:01,792 --> 00:50:03,096
♪ Let the hills rejoice... ♪

814
00:50:03,181 --> 00:50:06,228
Are you and Daddy
gonna sleep in here?

815
00:50:06,474 --> 00:50:08,607
Yeah, yeah.

816
00:50:09,104 --> 00:50:11,889
We're all going to be together.

817
00:50:12,632 --> 00:50:15,210
Is Julie
ever coming back?

818
00:50:15,496 --> 00:50:17,472
Honey,
she's right up the hill.

819
00:50:17,557 --> 00:50:19,559
You can see her
anytime you want.

820
00:50:19,897 --> 00:50:21,638
- Okay.
- Okay?

821
00:50:24,554 --> 00:50:25,946
Shall we have a read?

822
00:50:26,077 --> 00:50:27,774
[Ethan] Yeah!

823
00:50:35,048 --> 00:50:36,484
All right.

824
00:50:36,569 --> 00:50:39,248
Last I remember,
it was chapter three.

825
00:50:39,385 --> 00:50:41,126
Start from the beginning.

826
00:50:41,211 --> 00:50:43,170
[Chuckles]

827
00:50:43,322 --> 00:50:45,629
Yeah.
It has been a while.

828
00:50:45,714 --> 00:50:47,194
♪ All your children here... ♪

829
00:50:47,279 --> 00:50:50,618
Well, it all began
one sunny morning,

830
00:50:50,861 --> 00:50:54,773
as a cat lay
comfortably basking in the sun,

831
00:50:54,932 --> 00:50:56,499
in a beautiful green shire.

832
00:50:56,629 --> 00:50:58,539
As we always do,

833
00:50:58,624 --> 00:51:01,323
let's welcome
our newest family member.

834
00:51:01,506 --> 00:51:02,812
Here's to Julie.

835
00:51:02,897 --> 00:51:04,550
[All] To Julie!

836
00:51:04,635 --> 00:51:07,638
[cheering and whooping]

837
00:51:07,884 --> 00:51:09,234
Thank you.

838
00:51:09,555 --> 00:51:10,846
Welcome, kiddo.

839
00:51:10,931 --> 00:51:12,976
Oh, we're glad to have you.

840
00:51:13,061 --> 00:51:16,497
<i>♪ If it be your will ♪</i>

841
00:51:19,966 --> 00:51:23,290
<i>♪ And end this night ♪</i>

842
00:51:24,356 --> 00:51:27,983
<i>♪ If it be your will ♪</i>

843
00:51:31,925 --> 00:51:35,668
<i>♪ Ah, ah ♪</i>

844
00:51:35,753 --> 00:51:39,926
<i>♪ If it be your will ♪</i>

845
00:51:44,068 --> 00:51:45,809
<i>♪ Oh, oh ♪</i>

846
00:51:55,149 --> 00:51:58,718
<i>♪ Oh, Lord ♪</i>

847
00:51:58,936 --> 00:52:01,112
<i>♪ If it be your will ♪</i>

848
00:52:02,738 --> 00:52:05,132
[Voices whispering]

849
00:52:10,790 --> 00:52:13,576
[Pants]

850
00:52:23,803 --> 00:52:25,240
[Blinds rattle]

851
00:52:35,641 --> 00:52:38,601
- [Voices overlapping]
- [Giggling]

852
00:52:48,611 --> 00:52:51,527
[Groans]

853
00:52:53,790 --> 00:52:55,618
[Whimpers]

854
00:53:05,192 --> 00:53:06,542
[Screams]

855
00:53:09,284 --> 00:53:17,284
[Instrumental music plays]